// Powder Cellar: the data-driven material and reaction tables as a chain of
// chemistry in the dark, each step started by the one before. Only the falling
// brand is scripted; every later step comes from the material table.
//
// A burning brand drops out of a lantern onto a gunpowder trail. Gunpowder
// explodes at 200 C with radius 9, so the trail burns as a crackling line of
// small blasts along the floor, up the stone stair and along the shelf to two
// powder kegs with TNT cores. Every cell of a charge grows the blast it joins,
// so the kegs go up as one blast with a white flash. It blows apart the acid
// carboy that stood on them and bursts the oil tank hung under the landing,
// throwing burning oil down into the bay. Acid eats brick, stone, wood and
// metal into green acid_gas but not glass, which is why it was kept in glass:
// it runs down the brick wall eating into it, and eats the jar shelf so its
// jars tumble. The burning oil lights bundles of dry brush on the floor (leaves
// catch at 160 C and flare up), and the fire runs along the bay and up into the
// hanging oil barrels. In the last bundle is the drain mouth: a second trail
// runs under the bedrock floor as a white hot seam and comes up into the
// powder store. A floor keg goes first, then the TNT crates (150 C, radius 18)
// under, on and above the timber gallery, each a separate blast of radius 48
// that sets off the next: a white flash that lights the whole cellar, a
// fireball two hundred cells across that tears down the lanterns over the
// store, and burning oil from the gallery barrels sprayed over the room.
//
// The light is the reactions' own: lamps and torches, sparks, burning oil and
// brush, the flashes, and the acid's green glow.
[scene]
name = powder cellar
description = A brand drops on a powder trail in a dark vaulted cellar; the spark runs up the stair to the kegs, whose blast frees a carboy of acid that eats the wall and bursts an oil tank over bundles of brush, the brush fire lights a second trail that runs under the floor as a glowing seam, and a store of TNT crates goes up in a rolling blast that lights the whole cellar.
size = 760 430
seed = 0x1234
ticks = 1200

